1
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:13,008
Have you ever really wanted to do something that someone who loves you said not to do?

2
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:17,350
God planted a beautiful garden, called Eden.

3
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:23,737
It had rivers of cool water, flowers of every color, and trees with delicious fruit.

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:29,950
God put Adam in the garden to take care of it. And Adam gave a name to every animal:

5
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:33,833
the lion, the giraffe, the turtle... What a fun job!

6
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:40,009
But Adam still didn't have anyone like him, to talk with and share his life.

7
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:44,220
So God made Eve, and Adam was very happy!

8
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:49,028
God said, “You may eat from every tree in the garden.

9
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:56,596
Just don't eat from this tree here, the tree of the knowledge of good and evil. It will hurt you.”

10
00:00:57,900 --> 00:01:01,610
One day, a very clever serpent whispered to Eve:

11
00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:06,857
“God doesn't want you to eat it, because you would become wise like Him.”

12
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:09,517
That was a lie!

13
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:15,329
Eve looked at the fruit... took it, ate it, and gave some to Adam, who ate it too.

14
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:18,999
Right away, they felt sad and ashamed.

15
00:01:20,900 --> 00:01:26,218
In the evening, when they heard God walking in the garden, Adam and Eve hid.

16
00:01:26,700 --> 00:01:29,336
But no one can hide from God.

17
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:34,958
Disobeying had consequences: they had to leave the garden.

18
00:01:35,900 --> 00:01:40,574
But God made warm clothes for them, and kept on taking care of them.

19
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:46,144
And He promised that one day, He would send someone to make everything right.

20
00:01:46,700 --> 00:01:50,431
God's rules are like a fence that keeps us safe.

21
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:56,150
And even when we make mistakes, God never stops loving us.

22
00:01:56,300 --> 00:02:01,217
Talk with your family: what is one rule in your home that keeps you safe?

23
00:02:05,300 --> 00:02:10,019
Subscribe to the channel! Next story: Noah and the Great Ark.

